            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova oona kana ũthũku wa mũndũ waĩ mũnene kũũ nthĩ, na kĩla kĩsũanĩo kya malilikano ma ngoo yake kyaĩ kyathe vyũ mavinda onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
